538600865565404_8021931410350376011_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D_rqGT0E4YIQ7kNvwFzjVQA&_nc_oc=Adpaw1OwdOnQSqP1TfkPLuqeavXNae4xwmrb9IHhuUlIRMGD6uXDl01x-YHLLRMIK-c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSjfnsGkWLnvmHTjEkxQXw3PrbuowW0LnWb9x0-G2zBaQ&oe=6B06F88D"}, "display_name": "Neon Cipher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Neon Cipher is an action-packed puzzle-platformer designed for smooth and engaging gameplay. Across 50 levels, you'll use third- and first-person mechanics to solve intricate puzzles and battle enemies blocking your path.\n\nAs a new recruit in a small team of hackers, your mission is to infiltrate XE_CORP's archive database and retrieve vital information for the Edenite Rebellion, crucial to its survival.\n\n# Third-Person Gameplay\n{663687826393284}\nUse classic third-person controls to move your character around, attack, enemies and interact with objects. Collect all the keys to open the door and complete each cipher.\n\n# First-Person Gameplay\n{1327023925018371}\nSometimes your character may need a little help. Reach into the cipher with your controllers to move platforms. Also you can stun enemies to make the fighting a little easier.\n\n# Editor\n{1009083324695992}\nCreate and play your own ciphers using the built-in editor.\n\n*A note on legacy headset support:\nPlease note, versions of Neon Cipher for Meta Quest 2 and Pro are still in development. We hope to bring them to you as soon as we can!", "short_description": "Neon Cipher is an action-packed puzzle-platformer designed for smooth and engaging gameplay. Across 50 levels, you'll use third- and first-person mechanics to solve intricate puzzles and battle enemies blocking your path."}]}, "developer_name": "eXomorph Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://exomorph.games/privacy-neon-cipher", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "eXomorph Games", "support_website_url": null, "web